      "writtenOn": "2020-03-13T23:58:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem with killing it on NOT_READY is that during a PSIM switch we also go to NOT_READY, and ideally that wouldn\u0027t make us non-administrators (which I was hoping to avoid). Ugh, eSIM, but thanks for pointing that out. Ih had forgotten about that.",
