        "id": 1124543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-14T00:02:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NOT_READY could maybe cause us to linger for ~30 seconds before the tracker opts to blow away past SIM-related certs? If in that time, we get a LOADED or ABSENT, we know for sure what to do (overwrite with the current SIM\u0027s contents or remove all SIM-related certs, respectively).\n\nBoth pSIM and eSIM hit this problem, they both go to NOT_READY in the middle of a switch. The only additional wrinkle for eSIM is that NOT_READY is also the terminal state if there\u0027s no destination profile on the other side. pSIM is technically incapable of landing in that state forever.",
      "parentUuid": "258a6667_4d36c67a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 170,
        "startChar": 16,
